+- Freezing (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`) is allowed to managers only (others 403; archived → 409). It changes every member's role to `viewer`, managers included, in one transaction, and returns the members as `[{"userId","role"}]` ordered by user ID. Since viewers cannot write, nobody can change the project's tasks afterwards. A second freeze is refused with 403, because the managers have become viewers. There is no unfreeze.
